  "title": "重磅！AI 补全人类史上最大数学证明，数学家当场泪崩",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3MTA0MTk1MA==&mid=2652739321&idx=2&sn=89a62a3f6714857e4b2a03813f317395",
  "date": "2026-10-30 19:56:00",
