  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>原创 <span>ASI启示录</span> <span>2026-10-30 19:56</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">北京</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=125c422b&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FRvq8Ow69CYW03AnBeZ5FDD6CULxzb0QPGoOvRFGopLF4I0B60jxzhxaIH2yS5iaHCnzr208MEbD9DPeNc27N669icmic8ZgTibOyCwnPR7Kv8uM%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\"></p>\n  <h3 data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\" style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;\">\n   <div data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"88402\" style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 27.2px;widows: 1;visibility: visible;\">\n    <div data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"88402\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 27.2px;visibility: visible;\">\n     <div data-style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; color: rgb(117, 114, 114);white-space: normal;\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n      <div style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n       <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.425\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"width:100%;\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Rvq8Ow69CYUX0taxZPxZqAiaCtKWIQjcvv6qtDFx5HPHKEVtqGwaNLA6XiaHNmDlvy6KgJp1pNic9snlcKoAhhv7lOJibdlKDnQAd0aH1W47xJg/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"246\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"246\" data-imgfileid=\"505255547\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261030122502_bce0ad9.jpeg\"></span></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </h3>\n  <h3 style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;\">\n   <div data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"88402\" style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 27.2px;widows: 1;visibility: visible;\">\n    <div data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"88402\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 27.2px;visibility: visible;\">\n     <div style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n      <div style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n       <p style=\"margin-top: -1.2em;margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 1px;visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 1em;font-family: inherit;text-decoration: inherit;visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.4;font-family: inherit;font-weight: inherit;text-decoration: inherit;background-color: rgb(127, 127, 127);visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\">新智元报道 &nbsp;</span></span></strong></span></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </h3>\n  <div powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;\">\n   <div style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n    <div style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n     <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.06944444444444445\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"40\" data-imgfileid=\"505219475\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260717064332_e57fe10.png\"></span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">人类历史上规模最大的数学证明，现已通过计算机形式化验证。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">有限单群分类定理（CFSG，Classification of Finite Simple Groups）</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，刚刚被AI彻底形式化！</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5250000000\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1200\" style=\"width:456px;height:239px;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"303\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261030122502_7f662b6.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">百余名全球顶尖数学家历经大半个世纪、写下长达15000页的「数学天书」，被初创团队Axiom研发的多智能体系统在</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">短短24天内</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">全部跑通。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">更让人头皮发麻的是，AI构建了人类史上首个超4000万行的Lean代码库。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">按代码行数计算，这现在是史上最大的开源软件项目。它的规模超过了 Linux 内核、Chromium、Firefox、LLVM、GCC、FFmpeg 等。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5693750000\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1600\" style=\"width:412px;height:235px;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"329\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261030122502_034074b.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">它甚至还在原有的证明中揪出了人类的漏洞，并亲自证明了新的数学定理来完成修补！</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">知名数学家Ken Ono动情发文，悼念今年1月去世的数学家父亲。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">他回忆起童年时父亲引荐自己走近群论巨匠的岁月，在见证人机协作跨过这条历史终点线时，这位数学大师忍不住当场泪崩。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.2324786325\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1170\" style=\"width:397px;height:489px;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"712\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261030122502_479d44a.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" style=\"width: 85px;height: 40px;\" src=\"https://image.jido.dev/20251204131046_bea6b283\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 19px;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">数学的「对称周期表」：巨型定理</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">在数学界，这个定理有一个如雷贯耳的绰号——</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">「巨型定理」（The Enormous Theorem）</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.2515611062\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1121\" style=\"width:247px;height:309px;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"723\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261030122502_9057353.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">在此之前，世界上没有任何一个人能够从头到尾完整通读它的所有证明。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">到底什么是「群」？</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">简单来说，</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">群是描述「对称性」的数学语言。</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">比如，描述正六边形的对称性，对应一个二面体群群：</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4804753820\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2356\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"278\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261030122502_04f5694.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">比如，用图论看魔方，每个状态是一个顶点，每一步移动是这张巨大图中的一条边。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"720\" style=\"width:469px;height:235px;\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"289\" data-imgfileid=\"505255543\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261030122502_b94192d.gif\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;font-size: 12px;color: #888888;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这段动画展示了排列如何穿越 43 百亿亿种配置，最终抵达解法。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">而所有的有限群，都可以像化学分子被分解为原子一样，被分解为不可再分的「基本构件」——这就是</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">有限单群（Finite Simple Groups）</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">分类定理的伟大之处就在于，它为全宇宙的对称性开列了一张「元素周期表」</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">。</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.8900000000\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1200\" style=\"width:440px;height:392px;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"514\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261030122502_a506b44.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">它明确宣告：</span></strong></p>\n  <div style=\"line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;word-break: break-word;color: rgb(91, 91, 91);border-left: 8px solid rgba(158, 158, 158, 0.3);border-radius: 5px;background: rgba(158, 158, 158, 0.1);padding-top: 24px;padding-bottom: 24px;padding-right: 8px;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n   <p style=\"font-size: 15px;margin: 0 8px;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">所有的有限单群，要么属于素数阶循环群，要么属于至少5个符号的交错群，要么属于16个无限家族的李型群，要么，就属于26个极度特殊、无法归类的「零散群」（Sporadic groups）。</span></strong></p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这26个零散群中，最大的一个被数学家敬畏地称为</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">「魔群」（Monster Group）</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">顺便提一句，1998年，Richard Borcherds因证明著名的「怪兽月光猜想」（Monstrous Moonshine），荣获菲尔兹奖 。这一猜想揭示了数学中一个令人震惊的联系：最大的散在单群「魔群」，竟然与数论中的模函数存在深刻的数学关联。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.0498366013\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1224\" style=\"width:324px;height:340px;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"607\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261030122502_52d9eea.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">2007年，物理学巨擘Edward Witten更是提出，这套包含魔群的理论，可能被用来描述一个简化宇宙中的引力，用来编码黑洞在不同能级上的量子态分布，从而计算黑洞的熵！</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">从1950年代开始，为了证明</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">巨型定理，</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">大约100位数学家在500多篇学术论文中，拼凑出了长达15000页的证明，约14部《红楼梦》。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">它太庞大、太分散了，以至于1983年数学家Gorenstein宣布证明完成时，其实还漏掉了一个巨大的缺口，直到2004年才由Aschbacher和Smith用1221页的论文补上。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.7000000000\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1200\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"405\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261030122502_b4fd920.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">因为证明实在太长，人类极容易出错。正如Aschbacher所言：「要写出一个非常长且复杂的论证而不犯错，是不可能的。」</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">既然人类的大脑已经逼近处理复杂逻辑的极限，那么，是时候让AI登场了。</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" style=\"width: 85px;height: 40px;\" src=\"https://image.jido.dev/20251204131046_bea6b283\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 19px;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">AI出征：24天，干了人类半个世纪的活</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">面对这座1.5万页的「数学珠穆朗玛峰」，Axiom团队没有选择传统的蛮力计算，而是动用了多智能体蜂群——</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">AxiomProver</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">把人类的自然语言证明翻译成Lean代码（即「形式化」），就等同于让一台铁面无私的机器，用放大镜去检验那15000页纸上的每一个标点符号。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">2026年10月1日</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，Axiom团队在一个Slack频道里敲下了启动的指令。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">人类工程师和数学家将庞大的「巨型」拆解成108个里程碑和约380个小任务，生成了一张巨大的「证明地图」。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.034013605442177\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"588\" style=\"width:306px;height:316px;\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Rvq8Ow69CYXbxbx10hy0fDkTHZlqdaqJVvXp3H8VYmcO4kwicsvz6tkwwvaSIHwhPDd484B9N7lyicvXVTgOibicSooU6MKer3I1OJLf5N4bMib0/640?from=appmsg\" data-cropx1=\"251.7437722419929\" data-cropx2=\"839.7864768683274\" data-cropy1=\"0\" data-cropy2=\"607.2597864768683\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"325\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261030122502_45d208d.jpeg\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">10月2日，第一批AI「蜂群」正式上线。</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这群AI智能体像一支训练有素的军队一样开始分工协作。领头的AI负责拆解高难度的论证，其他AI则疯狂搜索现有结果或埋头编写Lean代码。如果一个AI遇到了还没证明的先决条件，它会自动把这个任务外包给另一个AI。所有的结果都会汇聚到一个共享的代码库中。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">整个过程并非一帆风顺。由于AI编写代码的速度实在太快，Lean系统在重新检查依赖项时甚至出现了算力瓶颈。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Axiom的工程师不得不临时重构底层的工程基础设施，开发了一套分布式缓存系统，才勉强跟上AI那恐怖的产出速度。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"624\" style=\"width:100%;\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"325\" data-imgfileid=\"505255546\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261030122502_20b5d1f.gif\"></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">10月10日</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，Slack频道里弹出了一条让所有人沸腾的消息：</span></p>\n  <div style=\"line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;word-break: break-word;color: rgb(91, 91, 91);border-left: 8px solid rgba(158, 158, 158, 0.3);border-radius: 5px;background: rgba(158, 158, 158, 0.1);padding-top: 24px;padding-bottom: 24px;padding-right: 8px;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n   <p style=\"font-size: 15px;margin: 0 8px;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">我们证明了魔群是单群。</span></p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI不仅从结构信息中识别出了魔群，还通过代码彻底形式化了它的存在！</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">仅仅24天！</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5133333333\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1200\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"297\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261030122502_73d9f7b.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">在24个日日夜夜里，这群不知疲倦的AI智能体，产出了惊人的</span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\">4310万行</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">Lean代码，构建了人类目前最大的Lean代码库。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">人类的智慧，经过了机器无情的检验，而且发现了其中的逻辑漏洞！</span></p>\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n   <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin: 0px 8px 8px;\"><strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.25\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"292\" style=\"height: 20px;width: 81px;\" type=\"block\" src=\"https://image.jido.dev/20251206084007_1651184b\"></span></strong></p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">史诗级反转：AI揪出人类大师的「致命Bug」并亲手修复</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">人类的语言总是充满省略。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">有网友做词一首，调侃数学证明中的思维跳跃：</span></p>\n  <div style=\"line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;word-break: break-word;color: rgb(91, 91, 91);border-left: 8px solid rgba(158, 158, 158, 0.3);border-radius: 5px;background: rgba(158, 158, 158, 0.1);padding-top: 24px;padding-bottom: 24px;padding-right: 8px;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n   <p style=\"font-size: 15px;margin: 0 8px;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">西江月·证明</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size: 15px;margin: 0 8px;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">即得易见平凡，仿照上例显然</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size: 15px;margin: 0 8px;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">留作习题答案略，读者自证不难</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size: 15px;margin: 0 8px;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">反之亦然同理，推论自然成立</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size: 15px;margin: 0 8px;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">略去过程 Q.E.D.</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size: 15px;margin: 0 8px;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">由上可知证毕</span></p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">「显然可得」、「同理可证」、「易证」……这些数学论文里常见的词语，对AI来说却是行不通的。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">形式化证明要求每一步都必须有明确的逻辑支撑。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">在逐行扫描、强迫推理的过程中，AI智能体记录下了数百处异常。其中大部分是人类的笔误、表格错误或遗漏了前提条件，但有</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">34处</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">是重大的逻辑偏差！</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.2664872140\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1486\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"154\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261030122502_50e1197.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">而其中最惊险、最核心的一个「Bug」，出在至关重要的</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">不平衡群定理（Unbalanced Group Theorem, UGT）</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;上。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">UGT是整个分类定理中极为关键的一环，它的作用是「通过局部看整体」——通过研究一个群的子群结构，来推断出整个大群的真面目。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"193\" data-backw=\"578\" data-ratio=\"0.3333333333\" data-s=\"300,640\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1536\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261030122502_6602f85.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Axiom团队最初选择了John Walter在1986年发表的一篇权威文献作为形式化的基础。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">然而，在翻译这段人类自以为完美无缺的论证时，</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">AI智能体突然发出了红色警报！</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI发现，Walter证明中的一个关键闭包断言，在逻辑上是站不住脚的。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.3997308210\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1486\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"231\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261030122502_8d8586b.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI不仅指出了错误，还给出了一个明确的</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">反例</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">：PSL₂(49)。在这个反例中，一个操作会产生一个被明确排除在目标家族之外的群（因为7是梅森素数）。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.3333333333\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1536\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"193\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261030122502_0ee5992.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">人类引以为傲的证明，在这一刻断链了。</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">长达1.5万页的逻辑大厦，随时面临崩塌的危险。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">怎么办？如果去借用后人写的「第二代证明」，不仅会引入海量的全新依赖，还会让这24天的努力前功尽弃。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">此时，人机协作的巅峰一幕上演了。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Axiom团队紧急连线了当年参与CFSG原始工作的活化石——群论泰斗Richard Lyons和Ronald Solomon。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">在听取了AI发现的漏洞后，人类大师的直觉与AI的算力展开了完美共振。基于Solomon在1976年提出的理论，人类数学家构思出了一条新的证明路线。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">随后，</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">AxiomProver（AI系统）亲自上阵，根据新思路，严丝合缝地证明了一个全新的群论结果——Preservation of simple tops。</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5479233227\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1252\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"317\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261030122502_0fe1e68.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这个由AI主导证明的新定理，像一块完美的定制补丁，精准地填补了人类大师当年留下的窟窿，成功推导出了分类定理所需的UGT形式！</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">定理依然成立，但证明已经不完全属于人类了。</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这是人类历史上第一次，AI在最顶级的纯数学研究中，不仅充当了「验算器」，更成为了发现新定理、修补核心漏洞的「合作研究员」！</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这不禁让人想起数学史上类似的一幕：2002年菲尔兹奖得主Vladimir Voevodsky，发现自己的证明是错的，而且救不回来。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">1999–2000年，在普林斯顿高等研究院讲课时，他发现早年关键引理有误，原命题无法按原样挽救。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">2013年又确认1989年另一项结果也错了——反例早在1998年就有人提出。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.3523093448\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1862\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"204\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261030122502_00fc77e.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">他不再相信人类能可靠地检查复杂证明，转向Coq、同伦类型论与单值基础：让计算机验数学。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">在追求数学真理的道路上，人类用血肉之躯和有限的大脑，进行了长达近两百年的悲壮远征。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">如今，人类有了新的合作伙伴，一起探索知识疆域的星辰大海。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 12px;\"><span leaf=\"\">参考资料：</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://x.com/KenOno691/status/2115090084861247680\" target=\"_blank\">https://x.com/KenOno691/status/2115090084861247680</a></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://axiommath.ai/research/the-enormous-theorem-formalized/\" target=\"_blank\">https://axiommath.ai/research/the-enormous-theorem-formalized/</a></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 1px;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\">编辑：大卫</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\">秒追ASI</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\">⭐</span></strong><strong style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\">点赞、转发、在看一键三连</span></strong><strong style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\">⭐</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 15px;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\">点亮星标，锁定新智元极速推送！</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 24px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.2111111111111111\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"122\" data-imgfileid=\"505133683\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260717064332_62aefa3.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 24px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6129837703\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1602\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"354\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261016234653_5060e38.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Axiom 团队利用多智能体系统 AxiomProver，在 24 天内完成有限单群分类定理的全面形式化，构建了超 4310 万行的 Lean 代码库，并成功修复了原始证明中的关键逻辑漏洞，标志着 AI 在纯数学研究中实现了从验证到发现的飞跃。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Axiom 团队利用多智能体系统 AxiomProver，在 24 天内完成有限单群分类定理的全面形式化，构建了超 4310 万行的 Lean 代码库，并成功修复了原始证明中的关键逻辑漏洞，标志着 AI 在纯数学研究中实现了从验证到发现的飞跃。",
  "summary": "本文报道了 Axiom 团队在有限单群分类定理（CFSG）形式化工作中的重大突破。通过部署多智能体系统 AxiomProver，团队在 24 天内完成了对 15000 页数学证明的全面形式化，构建了人类历史上最大的 Lean 代码库。在这一过程中，AI 不仅成功识别并修复了原始证明中的关键逻辑错误，还独立证明了新的数学定理来补全缺口，展现了 AI 在纯数学研究中的强大能力。",
